  claim   = {and it names FOUR claims on the paper (claim-is-record, claims-are-warrants, fail-omits, paper-is-projection), every one of them a thesis-level claim whose grounding sits across the intro/model/engine boundary --- the deliberate forward-reference case the design predicted, not misfiling; so the residual behaves as a NAMING instrument (these claims owe a projected callback) rather than as a score to minimise, which is the disposition slides.bib's the-primitive-is-the-residual argued for},
  rests-on = {residual-calibrated-against-an-outside-arm}
